### ========================================================
### PRANAV ENTERPRISE REST API TEST SUITE
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Authenticate as Super Admin (Pranav Naik)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@pranav.com",
  "password": "P@ssword123!",
  "rememberMe": true
}

### Store Auth Token from login response
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 2. Register New User (Awaits approval by pranavnaik355@gmail.com)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Neha",
  "lastName": "Verma",
  "email": "neha.verma@pranav.com",
  "jobTitle": "Product Designer",
  "departmentName": "Product Management",
  "role": "Manager",
  "password": "P@ssword123!",
  "confirmPassword": "P@ssword123!"
}

### 3. Get Executive Dashboard KPI Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get All Employees Directory
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Search Employees by Name or Position
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?search=developer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Filter Employees by Department (1 = Software Engineering)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees?departmentId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Get Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Create New Employee (SuperAdmin / Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeCode": "EMP-3001",
  "firstName": "Vikram",
  "lastName": "Naik",
  "email": "vikram.naik@pranav.com",
  "phone": "+91 99000 88776",
  "position": "DevOps Lead",
  "salary": 140000,
  "hireDate": "2026-02-01T00:00:00Z",
  "status": 1,
  "departmentId": 3
}

### 9. Get All Strategic Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Get Project Details with Milestones & Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Create New Strategic Project (SuperAdmin / Admin / Manager)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectCode": "PRJ-SEC-01",
  "name": "Zero Trust Security Gateway",
  "description": "Enterprise micro-segmentation and multi-factor hardware security layer.",
  "clientName": "Global Defense Systems",
  "budget": 350000,
  "startDate": "2026-04-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "status": 1,
  "managerId": 1
}

### 12. Get All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Filter Tasks by Status (0 = ToDo, 1 = InProgress, 2 = InReview, 3 = Done)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 14. Quick Status Transition for a Task
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

3
